    {
      "name": "Boomstrike",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The kareq beats its legs against its reverberation chamber, creating a blast of sound concentrated enough to ignite the air around it. The kareq chooses to affect either a 30ft Cone (which deals sonic damage) or a 60ft Line (which deals fire damage). Affected creatures must attempt a DC 21 Fortitude Saving Throw save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes no damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes 3d6 Fire Damage or 3d6 Sonic Damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes 6d6 Fire Damage or 6d6 Sonic Damage and either is Deafened for 1 minute (if sonic damage) or takes 1d6 Persistent,fire Damage (if fire damage).</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
